OL,8,G0306 Outlook
OL,9,     FHow Copa 71, the first women's
OL,10,     FWorld Cup, took on football's 'old
OL,11,     Fmen'. We hear from two Danish
OL,12,     Ffootballers who played in the most
OL,13,     Fwatched women's sporting event in
OL,14,     Fhistory.
OL,15,G0350 Witness History
OL,16,     FIn 1964, a group of teenage boys
OL,17,     Forganised a convention in New
OL,18,     FYork, now recognised as the first
OL,19,     Fofficial Comic Con. It kickstarted
OL,20,     Fwhat's become a worldwide cultural
OL,21,     Fphenomenon.
